	<p data-i18n-html="about.intro">
		I am a <strong>Full Stack Software Engineer and AI/ML Specialist</strong> based in Brasília, Brazil. Currently pursuing a Master’s degree in Informatics (PPGI) at the <strong>Universidade de Brasília (UnB)</strong>, my research centers on efficient vector search and lightweight natural language processing within the Signal Processing Group (GPDS).
	</p>

	<p data-i18n-html="about.p1">
		Over the past years, I have worked across diverse engineering domains: from architecting high-scale digital banking features in <strong>Kotlin and Spring Boot</strong> at Caja Municipal Cusco, to developing acoustic biometric analysis applications in <strong>React Native, Electron, and Express</strong> at ML Orange, and engineering clinical ERP interfaces at Smart Cities Perú.
	</p>

	<p data-i18n-html="about.p2">
		My core philosophy blends strict software craftsmanship with pragmatic AI engineering: clean modular code, observable architectures, hardware-accelerated processing, and user-centric interfaces. Whether orchestrating distributed systems, tuning convolutional neural nets, or optimizing embedded mobile pipelines, I build robust software designed to deliver real-world impact.
	</p>
